WEBVTT

00:26.690 --> 00:27.570
Grim.

01:27.780 --> 01:28.990
It's pointless.

01:39.580 --> 01:43.290
Not even repenting will earn
you mercy at this point.

01:44.760 --> 01:46.540
Devil child.

01:47.800 --> 01:49.300
That works for me.

01:51.010 --> 01:56.010
I WAS REINCARNATED AS THE 7TH PRINCE SO I CAN TAKE
MY TIME PERFECTING MY MAGICAL ABILITY 2ND SEASON

01:56.510 --> 02:02.520
EPISODE 13: I'LL JOIN THE CHURCH!

02:07.320 --> 02:11.350
Lloyd... er, Master,
it's time for breakfast.

02:13.450 --> 02:14.990
Grim! Shiro!

02:15.780 --> 02:17.210
Good morning.

02:18.990 --> 02:19.700
Huh?

02:20.750 --> 02:22.000
Where's Lloyd?

02:23.660 --> 02:25.170
G'Morning.

02:30.430 --> 02:31.920
That voice...

02:36.050 --> 02:37.469
Lloyd!

02:37.470 --> 02:41.469
I'm able to hide my presence pretty well now,
with the mana block you taught me.

02:41.470 --> 02:44.229
"Pretty well" is an understatement!
That was perfect!

02:44.230 --> 02:47.480
It took me a year to learn
how to even use it at all...

02:47.880 --> 02:50.080
Lloyd, you really are...

02:50.480 --> 02:51.480
GASP...

02:52.190 --> 02:54.649
I mean, you're amazing, Master! Sir!

02:54.650 --> 02:57.739
What? You're still
not used to working here?

02:57.740 --> 03:00.009
It's been a couple of days already,
hasn't it?

03:00.010 --> 03:03.000
A couple of days isn't enough to get
used to something like that! Sir!

03:03.430 --> 03:08.579
Miss Sylpha has been teaching me lots,
but she's so strict! And cool!

03:08.580 --> 03:14.509
And learning etiquette is so hard!
But the food is good! And the beds are soft!

03:14.510 --> 03:16.760
That sure sounds like a lot.

03:17.180 --> 03:23.139
But I'm going to do my best to be the kind of
servant you'd be proud of, Lloyd... er, Master!

03:23.140 --> 03:24.059
Sir!

03:24.060 --> 03:26.390
You can be more casual
when it's just the two of us.

03:27.690 --> 03:28.899
Lloyd...!

03:28.900 --> 03:30.819
No, she certainly cannot.

03:30.820 --> 03:33.070
G'MORNING, SYLPHA.
G'Morning, Sylpha.

03:33.430 --> 03:36.820
Unbelievable... How many times
do I need to say it?

03:37.200 --> 03:39.529
RUMBLE...
What kind of maid speaks to her master

03:39.530 --> 03:41.079
RUMBLE...
tso casually?

03:41.080 --> 03:43.079
RUMBLE...
I'm so sorry!

03:43.080 --> 03:44.559
- Yes! I'm sorry!
- It doesn't matter what Prince Lloyd says!

03:44.560 --> 03:45.159
- Ren's certainly got her hands full.
- It doesn't matter what Prince Lloyd says!

03:45.160 --> 03:47.079
- Ren's certainly got her hands full.
- Some things are just out of the question!

03:47.080 --> 03:51.339
- Speaking of... I bet the others are busy too.
- If you can't sort this kind of thing out,

03:51.340 --> 03:53.089
you'll never be a proper maid!

03:53.090 --> 03:54.340
So if you do it again—

04:02.930 --> 04:07.730
Looks like your webs are coming in really
handy with the reconstruction, Galilea!

04:09.650 --> 04:11.900
You getting used to life as a governor?

04:12.290 --> 04:13.899
Somehow, yeah.

04:13.900 --> 04:17.820
I would've never imagined you
as the governor of Lordost Island.

04:19.120 --> 04:23.330
I thought Prince Lloyd was going
to take over, to be honest.

04:24.910 --> 04:29.920
My father gave me the authority
to appoint the governor, that's all.

04:31.800 --> 04:33.420
I'm leaving the rest in your hands.

04:34.000 --> 04:37.589
This place is going to be a great source
of research if it becomes a haven

04:37.590 --> 04:39.679
to people like you guys.

04:39.680 --> 04:42.400
He's planning on taking full advantage
of this place, isn't he?

04:42.930 --> 04:47.430
Gotta say, it's probably gonna be a while
before the repairs are done.

04:49.520 --> 04:52.269
The demons made an absolute
mess of the place, after all.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.990
Hey, Babylon! It's been a while!

04:56.940 --> 04:58.950
If this place is mine to govern,

04:59.540 --> 05:02.699
I'm not letting the same
disaster happen again.

05:02.700 --> 05:05.659
It'd be great if we had something
to protect ourselves with...

05:05.660 --> 05:09.620
Well, if you want a demonic opinion,
I'd recommend divine sorcery!

05:11.210 --> 05:13.459
HUHHHHHHH?!
Huhhhhhhh?!

05:13.460 --> 05:14.879
Grim, you're...

05:14.880 --> 05:16.379
A demon?!

05:16.380 --> 05:18.009
What did you guys think I was?!

05:18.010 --> 05:18.969
DIDN'T SAY ANYTHING
What did you guys think I was?!

05:18.970 --> 05:20.719
DIDN'T SAY ANYTHING
And show some damn respect!

05:20.720 --> 05:22.969
I thought you were a flying,
talking goat...

05:22.970 --> 05:28.219
Divine sorcery... a kind of magic that only
church devotees get their hands on.

05:28.220 --> 05:32.599
Taking God's power into your body
and using its holiness to dispel evil!

05:32.600 --> 05:36.899
Which sounds like a load of crap,
but it sure is effective.

05:36.900 --> 05:39.200
God, huh...?

05:39.820 --> 05:41.619
Looking kinda skeptical, over here.

05:41.620 --> 05:44.489
We've lived our whole lives
without any kind of god or salvation.

05:44.490 --> 05:48.739
But hey, maybe now's the time
to join up with the church.

05:48.740 --> 05:50.999
Even if you're the only one
who does, Prince Lloyd...

05:51.000 --> 05:53.369
The church... right...

05:53.370 --> 05:55.000
Maybe. Someday.

05:56.460 --> 05:58.669
What did you do, boss?

05:58.670 --> 06:01.720
Aw, come on! Why do you
assume I did something?!

06:02.090 --> 06:04.760
I mean, I did, and it got me
kicked out, but...

06:05.720 --> 06:07.929
- Considering it was two years ago,
- He's already made a mess!

06:07.930 --> 06:09.269
- maybe they've forgotten about it?
- That's just like him!

06:09.270 --> 06:10.469
- maybe they've forgotten about it?
- Good job!

06:10.470 --> 06:12.729
And just talking about it has got me itching...

06:12.730 --> 06:14.480
- ...to learn divine sorcery!
- Go with him, Babylon.

06:15.410 --> 06:18.230
So, if it gets me some divine sorcery...

06:18.620 --> 06:19.820
Time to join the church!

06:26.240 --> 06:28.659
I haven't been here in two years!

06:28.660 --> 06:31.499
I've never really liked churches.

06:31.500 --> 06:33.499
You didn't have to come, y'know.

06:33.500 --> 06:37.750
W-Well... I had to stand in for Miss Sylpha,
since she's busy with work!

06:38.090 --> 06:42.510
And I wanted to spend time,
with... you... Lloyd.

06:44.680 --> 06:50.679
So, the plan is to serve the church
in order to learn divine sorcery?

06:50.680 --> 06:51.520
Yeah.

06:51.830 --> 06:57.269
Collecting funds, cleaning, reading scripture,
singing hymns, praying...

06:57.270 --> 06:59.229
If you keep that up for long enough,

06:59.230 --> 07:00.359
the heavenly host...

07:00.360 --> 07:01.899
- Yo, what's up?
- ...blesses you with divine sorcery.

07:01.900 --> 07:02.939
YO, WHAT'S UP?
- ...blesses you with divine sorcery.

07:02.940 --> 07:05.569
I see.
That certainly sounds like a hassle.

07:05.570 --> 07:06.860
Tell me about it.

07:15.250 --> 07:17.580
Father! Good afternoon.

07:18.210 --> 07:20.919
Good afternoon, my child.

07:20.920 --> 07:24.720
Come to the church to pray?
What a smart boy you are!

07:26.470 --> 07:29.220
AUUUGH!
It's L-L-Lloyd de Saloum!

07:29.670 --> 07:31.449
Wh-What are you doing here, you wretch?!

07:31.450 --> 07:33.579
I will never forget what
you did two years ago!

07:33.580 --> 07:36.809
The hell that you unleashed
on this church!

07:36.810 --> 07:41.319
Begone! Demon spawn, I cast you out!

07:41.320 --> 07:43.980
What the hell did he do?

07:44.330 --> 07:47.490
Oh, Father, hasn't it been long enough?

07:47.910 --> 07:49.159
Escher?

07:49.160 --> 07:51.989
It's been so long, Lloyd!

07:51.990 --> 07:54.409
You are always too soft
on these matters!

07:54.410 --> 07:57.750
But aren't you always saying, Father...

07:58.120 --> 08:02.709
that, though people may make mistakes,
as long as they repent and apologize,

08:02.710 --> 08:04.419
S'ALL GOOD!
- God will forgive them?

08:04.420 --> 08:05.549
- S'all good!
- God will forgive them?

08:05.550 --> 08:07.780
And it's not like anyone is still angry.

08:08.260 --> 08:10.509
I still am!

08:10.510 --> 08:11.400
FLUFF
I still am!

08:13.970 --> 08:16.480
He's so sorry, woof.

08:19.190 --> 08:23.479
Just so you're aware, I have not
completely accepted your return...

08:23.480 --> 08:29.029
That said, I am not opposed to
giving you a chance to repent.

08:29.030 --> 08:30.529
Now, what's this good boy's name?

08:30.530 --> 08:31.620
Shiro.

08:34.240 --> 08:37.079
I'm expecting you all to be
diligent in your efforts.

08:37.080 --> 08:37.910
Sure!

08:38.750 --> 08:41.500
SEVEN MINUTES LATER

08:49.510 --> 08:53.010
Uh, Lloyd?! Where are you going?!

08:53.440 --> 08:55.559
Sorry, Escher.
I messed up.

08:55.560 --> 08:59.269
Well, if it was an honest mistake,
there's not much that can be done.

08:59.270 --> 09:01.939
You weren't hurt, though, were you?

09:01.940 --> 09:04.020
Uh, oh, no.

09:04.390 --> 09:07.109
Oh, that's such a relief! I'm glad.

09:07.110 --> 09:11.779
Wait, this is the stained glass vase
that the Father loves!

09:11.780 --> 09:15.529
I-It's fine. I'll apologize for you.

09:15.530 --> 09:19.039
Nah. I'll do it myself.

09:19.040 --> 09:22.039
Oh, you're such a good boy, Lloyd!

09:22.040 --> 09:24.290
- She's throwing Prince Lloyd off his game...
- She's throwing Lloyd off his game...

09:27.300 --> 09:30.799
What's wrong with Lloyd?
He's acting weird.

09:30.800 --> 09:34.799
Oh, I don't think so!
Lloyd has always been a good boy.

09:34.800 --> 09:39.479
Always? What was Lloyd... er,
the Prince like when he was younger?

09:39.480 --> 09:41.059
He hasn't really changed.

09:41.060 --> 09:45.060
He loves magic so much, to the point that
he loses interest in everything else...

09:45.530 --> 09:49.859
His joining the church this time is
to learn divine sorcery, too, right?

09:49.860 --> 09:51.320
Well, I dunno...

09:52.320 --> 09:54.420
He really hasn't changed.

09:55.070 --> 09:58.020
He used to break vases before, too.

09:59.250 --> 10:02.329
Lloyd! Did you do it again?!

10:02.330 --> 10:04.250
You're not hurt, are you?!

10:04.710 --> 10:06.089
Nope.

10:06.090 --> 10:09.090
I see! Well, that's a relief.

10:10.340 --> 10:13.469
Y'know, you could be a bit
more strict with me...

10:13.470 --> 10:15.049
That's a good point!

10:15.050 --> 10:15.799
Bad boy!

10:15.800 --> 10:19.350
Not exactly like that...

10:20.350 --> 10:23.309
How about blasting me with
some divine sorcery?!

10:23.310 --> 10:25.099
I would never!

10:25.100 --> 10:30.109
Divine sorcery should only ever
be used against truly bad people.

10:30.110 --> 10:34.609
I'm proud of you, though, Lloyd.
Asking to be disciplined, like that.

10:34.610 --> 10:38.440
I know! Why don't we sing together?

10:45.880 --> 10:48.999
Some demonic-looking
creature is running amok!

10:49.000 --> 10:51.260
Everyone, evacuate the church!

10:51.760 --> 10:54.509
Wait, where's Lloyd?!

10:54.510 --> 10:58.010
THE CULPRIT

11:06.650 --> 11:09.150
Escher! Are you okay?!

11:09.490 --> 11:13.399
Lloyd... are you okay?!
Were you hurt?!

11:13.400 --> 11:16.280
N-No, I'm fine.

11:17.660 --> 11:20.910
I see... I'm so glad!

11:22.660 --> 11:25.160
Oh, there's a shocker.
And now I'm dead.

11:28.710 --> 11:34.339
Afterwards, Lloyd confessed what he had done,
and was kicked out of the church.

11:34.340 --> 11:36.180
Yeah, that explains it!

11:36.600 --> 11:40.799
He made an absolute mess of
the Father's collection...

11:40.800 --> 11:44.060
And people started calling him
demon spawn.

11:46.600 --> 11:51.189
But that can't be true.
I know better.

11:51.190 --> 11:54.150
I'm sure, if anything,
it's the other way around.

12:02.200 --> 12:05.290
Your voice... the way it sounds...

12:08.500 --> 12:11.170
I hope we can sing again.

12:11.840 --> 12:15.340
Actually, I should invite Lloyd to join us!

12:15.840 --> 12:19.299
Today there's going to be
a recital during communion today!

12:19.300 --> 12:20.680
Saria will be coming, too!

12:21.000 --> 12:22.350
Communion?

12:22.930 --> 12:24.260
Saria?

12:28.140 --> 12:30.980
I WAS REINCARNATED AS THE 7TH PRINCE SO I CAN TAKE
MY TIME PERFECTING MY MAGICAL ABILITY 2ND SEASON

12:35.280 --> 12:37.280
That hurt!

12:37.740 --> 12:40.989
Watch where you're going, dumbass!

12:40.990 --> 12:42.699
What's the commotion?

12:42.700 --> 12:45.450
Lloyd, what did you do this—

12:47.660 --> 12:50.580
My sister... Saria?

12:52.000 --> 12:55.299
You run into somebody
and this is your response?

12:55.300 --> 12:57.259
You gonna pay for my pal's medical bills?

12:57.260 --> 12:59.759
Is there any instrument you're good with?

12:59.760 --> 13:02.510
Nah, not really.

13:06.310 --> 13:06.889
Hold it!

13:06.890 --> 13:07.139
GRAB
Hold it!

13:07.140 --> 13:07.769
Hold it!

13:07.770 --> 13:09.979
Your sister, Saria?

13:09.980 --> 13:16.030
Yeah. She's the fourth princess of
the Saloum Kingdom, and a musical prodigy.

13:16.440 --> 13:18.900
A master of all manner of instruments.

13:20.650 --> 13:24.119
But she's completely oblivious
to anything that isn't music.

13:24.120 --> 13:26.539
Kind of a handful.

13:26.540 --> 13:27.909
It's hereditary...!

13:27.910 --> 13:30.659
Whoa, where do you think you're going?!

13:30.660 --> 13:33.669
Come to think of it,
there's one instrument I'm great with!

13:33.670 --> 13:35.669
What is it? Tell me!

13:35.670 --> 13:39.920
Nobody can top me when it comes
to making ladies squeal!

13:41.300 --> 13:42.760
Please, stop!

13:43.550 --> 13:47.059
Saria is my friend! Not an instrument!

13:47.060 --> 13:50.810
Well, would you get a load of
this fine instrument right here?

13:52.140 --> 13:54.480
See?! Such sweet music!

13:55.690 --> 13:57.569
Y-You mustn't!

13:57.570 --> 14:00.279
This should only happen between
two people who love each other!

14:00.280 --> 14:02.339
These are definitely some good, high notes.

14:02.340 --> 14:04.679
So you have to grab her there
to get this sound, huh...

14:04.680 --> 14:06.199
What are you saying, Saria?!

14:06.200 --> 14:10.949
Oh, no, today's recital
is going to be ruined!

14:10.950 --> 14:12.579
What recital?

14:12.580 --> 14:16.339
It's happening later today, apparently.
A recital featuring Escher and Saria.

14:16.340 --> 14:19.089
Supposedly it heals those
who listen to it...

14:19.090 --> 14:21.339
And it's quite popular.

14:21.340 --> 14:24.339
That explains why she's here.

14:24.340 --> 14:28.599
Prince Lloyd, about divine sorcery...

14:28.600 --> 14:32.230
What if it's cast with a ritual,
and not with a mana signature?

14:32.650 --> 14:35.599
Healing those who hear it...

14:35.600 --> 14:39.979
Interesting. I can't let that
recital be canceled, then.

14:39.980 --> 14:40.899
That's so naughty...!

14:40.900 --> 14:41.820
Ren.

14:42.740 --> 14:47.240
As good as those notes are, the fact that
Escher is crying is a major downside.

14:47.770 --> 14:49.160
You're terrible at this.

14:49.990 --> 14:53.329
I'm sure I could make Escher
cry out more pleasantly.

14:53.330 --> 14:56.000
Maybe phrase that differently, please?!

14:56.540 --> 15:01.299
And the best way to get good music
out of Escher is with my piano.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.629
Saria!

15:02.630 --> 15:05.380
Time to make you squeal, too!

15:06.890 --> 15:08.220
Mana focus...

15:11.410 --> 15:13.180
Succubus Scales!

15:27.110 --> 15:29.370
Yep. Looking good, Ren.

15:30.490 --> 15:32.289
Pretty impressive!

15:32.290 --> 15:36.169
She was able to avoid affecting us
and only put the priest and the thugs down.

15:36.170 --> 15:41.130
It's an application of the mana block
the guild uses, called mana focus.

15:42.390 --> 15:44.129
Mana focus...

15:44.130 --> 15:48.089
is opening a single aperture to release
mana during the mana block state...

15:48.090 --> 15:48.509
WHOOSH

15:48.510 --> 15:54.020
Not only is the pressure more powerful,
but it also makes for easier targeting.

15:54.560 --> 15:57.769
Plus, she did exactly like I told her,

15:57.770 --> 16:01.480
and is able to transmute her poison
into a knockout gas...

16:03.400 --> 16:05.900
You're working hard, Ren.

16:06.700 --> 16:09.029
Don't underestimate
the kinda grit that thugs have!

16:09.030 --> 16:13.329
I'm sorry, Lloyd! I can't produce poison
exactly how I like it yet!

16:13.330 --> 16:16.549
I was trying to make a dose that
would knock out an adult male...

16:16.550 --> 16:19.039
With guys that stupid,
sometimes you need a heavier dose.

16:19.040 --> 16:20.579
Who're you calling stupid?!

16:20.580 --> 16:23.299
You the reason
we're so damn sleepy, girl?!

16:23.300 --> 16:26.839
Given the situation, I guess I'll have
to put them to sleep the hard way.

16:26.840 --> 16:27.779
Nah.

16:27.780 --> 16:29.799
Even if we did knock them out,

16:29.800 --> 16:32.799
there's the chance they could
wake up and cause more trouble.

16:32.800 --> 16:34.929
Who the hell are you?!

16:34.930 --> 16:36.149
Move, twerp!

16:36.150 --> 16:37.810
If you don't, we'll squash you like a—

16:56.330 --> 16:58.580
I still have a lot to learn.

16:59.460 --> 17:04.590
Still not sure
where I ended up sending them.

17:05.840 --> 17:09.929
I can't believe there was such trouble
while we were sleeping...

17:09.930 --> 17:10.589
Yep!

17:10.590 --> 17:14.849
My companion, Babylon,
ran those thugs off, though!

17:14.850 --> 17:16.850
At Prince Lloyd's command.

17:18.770 --> 17:21.100
I can't stop shaking...

17:21.610 --> 17:23.610
That was Jade's technique!

17:24.560 --> 17:28.610
Just how much is this kid
going to boost our morale?

17:30.650 --> 17:32.860
I wish the others could have seen it...

17:33.460 --> 17:36.599
If we can figure out how to create
a mana signature for our techniques,

17:36.600 --> 17:38.869
then one day, Lloyd might be able to...!

17:38.870 --> 17:41.079
Father, it's nearly time.

17:41.080 --> 17:42.990
Oh, right you are.

17:44.630 --> 17:47.130
LEAN...

17:47.560 --> 17:51.610
I-It's good to see you again, Saria.

17:52.880 --> 17:56.050
L... Lo... Lloyd?

17:57.140 --> 18:00.349
She nearly forgot her brother's name.

18:00.350 --> 18:03.650
It's actually really impressive
that she remembers.

18:03.980 --> 18:05.609
- That's right! It's Lloyd.
- Even when it comes to family,

18:05.610 --> 18:06.479
- That's right! It's Lloyd.
- Saria only remembers...

18:06.480 --> 18:09.400
the names of those
who are involved with music.

18:09.990 --> 18:12.949
Then can Prince Lloyd play an instrument?

18:12.950 --> 18:16.410
Oh, no, but when it comes to singing,
he's so...

18:17.550 --> 18:18.539
That reminds me!

18:18.540 --> 18:23.120
Lloyd, would you like to sing
with us during the recital?

18:24.170 --> 18:25.540
No, Escher.

18:26.040 --> 18:28.550
He hasn't practiced enough.

18:28.970 --> 18:32.510
I don't need him mucking up our performance
with an unplanned accompaniment.

18:33.800 --> 18:35.749
RUSTLE RUSTLE
We can perform as a trio after

18:35.750 --> 18:38.349
RUSTLE RUSTLE
I've put him through his paces.

18:38.350 --> 18:39.310
WHAT?
What?

18:40.310 --> 18:44.980
Lloyd, pay close attention to our recital.

18:48.320 --> 18:51.609
I'm feeling a weird kind
of pressure right now.

18:51.610 --> 18:54.909
What now? Ignore them
and explore the church?

18:54.910 --> 18:56.819
Nah. I need to attend that recital!

18:56.820 --> 19:02.829
There's a chance that divine sorcery is cast
with a ritual, instead of a mana signature.

19:02.830 --> 19:03.439
MANA SIGNATURE

19:03.440 --> 19:08.629
You can create a variety of phenomena
via the execution of a mana signature...

19:08.630 --> 19:09.089
RITUAL

19:09.090 --> 19:11.509
But rituals allow people with enough mana

19:11.510 --> 19:14.300
to bring forth comparable
phenomena via song, or dance.

19:14.840 --> 19:17.550
A good example would be a rain dance.

19:20.600 --> 19:21.890
Prince Lloyd?

19:22.320 --> 19:23.640
Babylon?

19:24.430 --> 19:25.980
Did I imagine it?

19:28.210 --> 19:32.399
The wine for this recital has
a waiting list of three years!

19:32.400 --> 19:34.489
Be sure to appreciate it.

19:34.490 --> 19:35.640
Sure!

19:36.950 --> 19:41.030
Who's a good boy?!
Who's a good, good, good boy?!

20:17.990 --> 20:21.369
So, this is Escher and Saria's music,

20:21.370 --> 20:25.660
which can heal people and entrance gods...

20:26.370 --> 20:27.960
Amazing!

20:28.670 --> 20:30.830
Grim, are you seeing this?

20:32.170 --> 20:36.299
Y-Yeah, it's definitely been cast!
Divine sorcery!

20:36.300 --> 20:37.550
Bingo, then.

20:49.140 --> 20:51.399
What kind of mana signature is this?!

20:51.400 --> 20:55.109
It looks like a kind of sorcerous notation
formed out of geometric shapes?

20:55.110 --> 20:57.650
I've never seen or heard
of anything like it!

20:58.030 --> 21:03.409
As for its effect... there's a resemblance
to health-class spells.

21:03.410 --> 21:09.410
Looks like a rain of healing particulate
that has a radius of roughly 10-plus meters.

21:10.250 --> 21:11.169
So, are you gonna be all right?

21:11.170 --> 21:13.129
TINGLE
So, are you gonna be all right?

21:13.130 --> 21:14.879
TINGLE
Not gonna lie, it tingles.

21:14.880 --> 21:16.919
That's what's going on with you?

21:16.920 --> 21:21.969
I lucked out in that the caster,
Escher, doesn't have a ton of mana.

21:21.970 --> 21:24.179
It's not gonna do much damage like that.

21:24.180 --> 21:28.309
I was right about Escher being
able to use divine sorcery, then!

21:28.310 --> 21:30.940
She's earned the respect
of God's messengers!

21:31.440 --> 21:35.480
An unknown type of mana signature,
in a language that can't be read...

21:36.000 --> 21:38.189
This is getting really interesting!

21:38.190 --> 21:42.069
Interesting? Doesn't that mean
you've got nothing to go off of?

21:42.070 --> 21:43.699
What're you gonna do?

21:43.700 --> 21:47.949
Well, for one thing, I've been sensing
a strange gaze this entire time.

21:47.950 --> 21:49.199
A gaze?

21:49.200 --> 21:52.369
Yeah. One dripping with mana.

21:52.370 --> 21:55.209
And it's gotten stronger
since the recital began.

21:55.210 --> 21:57.709
A gaze... a gaze...

21:57.710 --> 21:59.559
SHUDDER
Whoa, you're right!

21:59.560 --> 22:01.469
SHUDDER
What the hell is this?! It feels nasty!

22:01.470 --> 22:03.590
And where's it coming from?

22:04.510 --> 22:06.469
I'd say from above.

22:06.470 --> 22:08.849
Is someone watching from the ceiling?

22:08.850 --> 22:11.890
Nope! Might be a lot higher up.

22:12.850 --> 22:17.189
Wouldn't it be fascinating
if it were one of God's servants?!

22:17.190 --> 22:19.859
Yeah, that'd be hilarious!

22:19.860 --> 22:22.810
And there you have it.
Ren, Babylon.

22:23.910 --> 22:25.280
I'll be right back.

22:29.790 --> 22:31.879
So far! And taking so long!

22:31.880 --> 22:34.329
I've never teleported this
kind of distance before!

22:34.330 --> 22:39.209
All I did was lock onto that mana-filled gaze
and activate Shadow Wolf...

22:39.210 --> 22:42.010
But I was definitely not
anticipating this kind of span!

22:51.220 --> 22:51.980
LLOYD

22:58.980 --> 23:01.319
Ow, ow, ow... What was that?

23:01.320 --> 23:03.990
It felt like I slammed into something.

23:04.990 --> 23:08.699
Whoa, you okay, Grim?! We're here.

23:08.700 --> 23:11.270
Where is "here", though?

23:15.170 --> 23:16.290
Good question.

23:20.750 --> 23:25.879
Man, it's real cold.
You think we're dead, boss?

23:25.880 --> 23:30.930
Nah, when I died before,
it was nothing like this.

23:37.230 --> 23:38.980
I've found them...

23:42.090 --> 23:44.150
The person who was watching.

23:50.490 --> 23:55.119
The new season begins with the debut
of a mysterious, beautiful new character.

23:55.120 --> 23:57.249
Who could they be?

23:57.250 --> 23:59.329
Next time, on Episode 14:

23:59.330 --> 24:01.129
EPISODE 14: JIHRIEL'S MIRACLES
"Jihriel's Miracles."

24:01.130 --> 24:04.049
EPISODE 14: JIHRIEL'S MIRACLES
You will witness the depths of sorcery.

24:04.050 --> 24:04.960
EPISODE 14: JIHRIEL'S MIRACLES
